 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(1)$ per splat, involving a constant number of arithmetic operations and a conditional branch [G].
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$, requiring no additional memory beyond the input coefficients and output color vector [G].
-- **Strengths:** Extremely fast execution makes it suitable for fallback rendering where full SH evaluation is not supported [G].
-- **Limitations:** Only provides diffuse color and ignores directional lighting effects captured by higher-degree SH coefficients [S1].
+
